# Everything a build should produce rather than copy. Keeping these out is not
# only about image size: a host's `node_modules` holds binaries built for the
# host, and an `apps/desktop/web` copied in would be a second, stale web app.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
apps/desktop/web
apps/api/vendor
apps/api/storage/logs/*
apps/api/storage/framework/cache/*
apps/api/storage/framework/sessions/*
apps/api/storage/framework/views/*
apps/api/database/database.sqlite
apps/api/.env
.git
.github
e2e
parity
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
